# Full demo + hosted agent demo (module 7): toolbox + hosted agent contoso-policy-hosted (Agent Framework), deployed
# post-provision by azd running on the jumpbox (in-network runner). Requires Foundry IQ. docs/modules/hosted-agent-demo.md
NETWORK_MODE=standalone
# Distinct project name per deployment (otherwise several 'private-demo' projects look identical in the portal)
FOUNDRY_PROJECT_NAME=standalone-demo
OUTBOUND_NETWORK_MODE=byoVnet
ENABLE_BASTION=true
ENABLE_JUMPBOX=true
ENABLE_AI_SEARCH=true
AI_SEARCH_SKU=basic
ENABLE_RAG_DEMO=true
ENABLE_AGENT_DEMO=true
ENABLE_ADVANCED_MONITORING=true
ENABLE_FOUNDRY_IQ=true
RAG_APP_PORT=8443
VNET_ADDRESS_PREFIX=10.80.0.0/16
PE_SUBNET_PREFIX=10.80.1.0/24
MANAGEMENT_SUBNET_PREFIX=10.80.2.0/24
BASTION_SUBNET_PREFIX=10.80.3.0/26
APP_SUBNET_PREFIX=10.80.4.0/24
AGENT_SUBNET_PREFIX=10.80.6.0/24
MODEL_NAME=gpt-5.4-mini
MODEL_VERSION=2026-03-17
MODEL_DEPLOYMENT_TYPE=DataZoneStandard
MODEL_CAPACITY=10
ENABLE_HOSTED_AGENT_DEMO=true
# Optional: agent-level guardrail (RAI policy on the account), default Microsoft.DefaultV2
# HOSTED_AGENT_RAI_POLICY=Microsoft.DefaultV2
